# FIRES gates/010_required.rq AND gates/020_capability_without_realization.rq
# (exactly those two): a capability missing its independently-stated
# dcap:compensatable / dcap:reversible / dcap:declaredOutcome — the
# COMPENSATABLE != REVERSIBLE pair must BOTH be stated, never defaulted — and, being
# unrealized, it is also capability-without-realization.
@prefix dcap:    <https://ggen.dev/ontology/durability-capability#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

dcap:capability-incomplete a dcap:Capability ;
    rdfs:label "Durability.Incomplete" ;
    dcterms:identifier "Durability.Incomplete" ;
    rdfs:comment "Missing compensatable/reversible/declaredOutcome: 010 rows = compensatable, reversible, declaredOutcome." .
